{"overview":"لوید یک جادوگر سفید است که به‌طور ناگهانی از گروه قهرمانان تبعید شد. در حالی که گم‌گشته و نامطمئن بود، به‌طور اتفاقی با یک گروه ماجراجویان رده S که به یک جادوگر سفید نیاز داشتند، برخورد کرد و به آن‌ها در مأموریتشان پیوست. هیچ‌کس در آن زمان نمی‌دانست که گروه قهرمانان خواهد پاشید و لوید به شهرت خواهد رسید.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Lloyd is a white mage who was unexpectedly banished from the hero's party. As he was lost and uncertain, he happened to cross paths with an S-rank adventurer party in need of a white mage, so he joined them on their quest. Little did anyone know at the time that the hero's party would fall apart and Lloyd would rise to fame.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":12,"y":2025,"poster":""},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2025,"poster":"/BjRyht0hiM24a6aQzXS51XVVBD.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"گاکوتو کاجیوارا","role":"Lloyd (voice)","photo":"/kUer38jXf7vTD2TGGxJMZVYL5Te.jpg","en":"Gakuto Kajiwara"},{"name":"日高里菜","role":"Yui (voice)","photo":"/7JupZGvqcq4dRxiTKpPxzg8NUS4.jpg","en":"Rina Hidaka"},{"name":"白石晴香","role":"Silica (voice)","photo":"/hrQxTVNGLi3jXC7v4kETArpA0dV.jpg","en":"Haruka Shiraishi"},{"name":"廣瀬大介","role":"Cross (voice)","photo":"/x1nZHTfsKjTaGbY2i0NUW8BNYSK.jpg","en":"Daisuke Hirose"},{"name":"梅原裕一郎","role":"Dougas (voice)","photo":"/lScrvZi4tKKpk3PbnIjLVjHVNJn.jpg","en":"Yuuichirou Umehara"},{"name":"木村良平","role":"Allen (voice)","photo":"/m4GktFKhjrVTewsZtqTusInHZqT.jpg","en":"Ryohei Kimura"},{"name":"石川由依","role":"Rina (voice)","photo":"/zptGIN1iklKJL1xrfHKOpxR2qJ9.jpg","en":"Yui Ishikawa"},{"name":"真野美月","role":"Miiya (voice)","photo":"/zkMKFskVzdovHNX92pEaXFb6TRB.jpg","en":"Mizuki Mano"},{"name":"七瀬彩夏","role":"Lulu (voice)","photo":"/9eKNKMFFhbtG74V3OOiVKEgm1ul.jpg","en":"Ayaka Nanase"},{"name":"大木咲絵子","role":"Sheena (voice)","photo":"/zmjFPl8uPSoCILFASp5sOjWUxmL.jpg","en":"Saeko Oki"}],"trailer":"","watch":